**Course/Path:** Data Structures & Algorithmic Problem-Solving
**Lesson:** 02 of 08
**Title:** Arrays, Vectors, Searching and Binary Search
**Duration:** 60 minutes
**Difficulty:** Intermediate
**Technology:** C++ (g++)

